error[6-0003]: trait bound is not satisfied
   ┌─ closures.fe:52:8
   │
52 │     xs.fold(0, |acc: mut, x| acc)
   │        ^^^^ `|mut u256, u256| -> u256` doesn't implement `FnMut_ov<u256, u256, Out = u256>`
   │
   ┌─ src/iter.fe:62:19
   │
62 │     fn fold<A, F: FnMut(own A, Self::Item) -> A>(self, _ init: own A, _ f: mut F) -> A
   │                   ----------------------------- required by this bound on `fold`

error[8-0019]: `break` is not allowed outside of a loop
   ┌─ closures.fe:58:13
   │
58 │             break
   │             ^^^^^ `break` is not allowed here

error[8-0036]: missing effect `Store` required by `any`
   ┌─ closures.fe:70:5
   │
70 │     xs.any(|x| x == read())
   │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `any` requires effect `Store` to be in scope
   │
   = provide it with `with (Store = value)` or require it via `uses Store`

