   ┌─ closures.fe:64:13
   │
64 │     let f = |x: u256| x
   │             ^^^^^^^^^^^ constant evaluation cannot evaluate a closure

error[8-0109]: closure has the wrong number of parameters
   ┌─ closures.fe:48:16
   │
48 │     xs.fold(0, |acc| acc)
   │                ^^^^^^^^^ expected a closure taking 2 parameters, found 1

error[8-0110]: cannot write to `total`, which a closure captures
   ┌─ closures.fe:18:9
   │
18 │         total += x
   │         ^^^^^ the closure only reads its copy
   │
   = closures capture by copy or move; thread state through parameters and results instead

error[8-0110]: cannot write to `a`, which a closure captures
   ┌─ closures.fe:28:17
   │
28 │         let r = mut a
   │                 ^^^^^ the closure only reads its copy
   │
   = closures capture by copy or move; thread state through parameters and results instead

error[8-0111]: a closure cannot capture the access `accounts`
   ┌─ closures.fe:35:32
   │
35 │     idx.fold(0, |acc, i| acc + accounts[i].balance)
   │                                ^^^^^^^^ an access of a non-`Copy` value is neither copied nor moved
   │
   = pass the value to the closure as a parameter instead

error[8-0112]: cannot move `a` out of a closure's captures
   ┌─ closures.fe:42:17
   │
42 │         consume(a)
   │                 ^ moved here
   │
   = each call of a closure only views its captures
